{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multiprofile, rna_only setting with avgpool aggregation, isolating the effect of profile configuration. Validation accuracy of 0.650 (F1: 0.628) exceeds the singleprofile baseline with scvi_n200 (0.520), suggesting multiprofile may improve performance for this encoder. However, the role of avgpool aggregation and interactions with other design choices remain uncertain, as comparisons to alternative aggregation methods or fusion strategies are not yet available."
}

